{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_362","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat PROGRESS.md; printf '\\\\n--- game files ---\\\\n'; ls Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game; printf '\\\\n--- source sizes ---\\\\n'; wc -l Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/*.{ts,css,html} Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/tools/*.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_362","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat PROGRESS.md; printf '\\\\n--- game files ---\\\\n'; ls Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game; printf '\\\\n--- source sizes ---\\\\n'; wc -l Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/*.{ts,css,html} Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/tools/*.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"# Wee Fit Retreat — progress\n\n## Current phase\n\n- Set up the required my-3dge workspace and inspect its game APIs.\n- Deliver the standalone `Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055.html` and matching development folder.\n\n## Implementation checklist\n\n- [ ] Build the island, activity progression, wobble simulation, controls, and persistence.\n- [ ] Add original presentation, synthesized audio, accessibility settings, and developer tools.\n- [ ] Integrate the AI Hub ghost protocol and package the standalone page.\n- [ ] Run the headless and cross-viewport/browser checks; address discovered issues.\n- [ ] Complete the About/credits information and `exit-interview.json`.\n\n## Testing notes\n\n- Issues caught: not yet measured. Critical issues: not yet measured.\n\n--- game files ---\nREADME.md\nart.ts\naudio.ts\nbest.test.ts\nbest.ts\nbot.ts\ncast\nindex.html\nmain.ts\nprogramme.ts\nreplays\nscenes\nstyles.css\ntools\nview.ts\nwobble.ts\n\n--- source sizes ---\n   35 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/art.ts\n   20 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/audio.ts\n   22 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/best.test.ts\n   33 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/best.ts\n   90 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/bot.ts\n  201 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/main.ts\n   49 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/programme.ts\n   43 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/view.ts\n   95 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/wobble.ts\n    2 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/styles.css\n   15 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/index.html\n   22 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/tools/bundle.mjs\n  627 total\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
