{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_564","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '%s\\\\n' '--- deliverables ---'; rg -n 'deliver|exit-interview|sourceInformation|testingFeedback|engineFeedback|promptFeedback|AIHub|session\\\\.js' TASK.md PLAN.md | head -n 75; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- source files ---'; P='Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055'; wc -l \\\"\"'$P\"/labs/game/{main,view,wobble,programme,art,audio}.ts; printf '\"'%s\\\\n' '--- render imports ---'; rg -n 'three|WebGLRenderer|Scene|renderer|camera' \\\"\"'$P\"/engine | head -n 55; printf '\"'%s\\\\n' '--- package scripts ---'; cat \\\"\"'$P/package.json\"'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_564","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '%s\\\\n' '--- deliverables ---'; rg -n 'deliver|exit-interview|sourceInformation|testingFeedback|engineFeedback|promptFeedback|AIHub|session\\\\.js' TASK.md PLAN.md | head -n 75; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- source files ---'; P='Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055'; wc -l \\\"\"'$P\"/labs/game/{main,view,wobble,programme,art,audio}.ts; printf '\"'%s\\\\n' '--- render imports ---'; rg -n 'three|WebGLRenderer|Scene|renderer|camera' \\\"\"'$P\"/engine | head -n 55; printf '\"'%s\\\\n' '--- package scripts ---'; cat \\\"\"'$P/package.json\"'","aggregated_output":"--- deliverables ---\nPLAN.md:95:**The five-day story** (delivered in one-liners, never in walls of text):\nPLAN.md:463:   the East Terrace (a sensor): each one delivered takes off 0.5°. Loungers slide through. Nan walks up on her own and is\nPLAN.md:476:remark, so the ending always comes. Score: delivered guests, tilt at the end of step 4, breath. It feeds the final remark only.\nPLAN.md:567:`labs/game/hub/`: `session.js` (save it as `session-client.txt`), and for tests `harness.html`, `bridge.js`, `round.js` from the same\nPLAN.md:593:const AIHub = window.AIHub;\nPLAN.md:594:const info = AIHub?.active ? await AIHub.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true }) : null;\nPLAN.md:596:const watchdog = info ? setTimeout(() => AIHub.ready(), 14000) : 0;   // the harness allows 20 s after hello\nPLAN.md:598:if (info) { clearTimeout(watchdog); AIHub.ready(); }\nPLAN.md:610:  Keys: Enter or Cross answers `AIHub.answer('ready')`, Triangle or T answers `'more'`, a tap or click works too. Listen for Enter with your own\nPLAN.md:611:  `keydown` on `window`: the harness sends a synthetic one. The card has no menus or choices, and draws numbers only from `AIHub.rng('card')`.\nPLAN.md:613:- `start` arrives; play begins at `AIHub.time() >= 0`. Send the sim `round.go` then (scene action). On `start` also send one\nPLAN.md:614:  `AIHub.progress({ score: 0, label: 'Breathing in' })` and one ghost message, so a slow copy still passes the harness.\nPLAN.md:615:- During play: `AIHub.progress({ score, label })` whenever it changes (label at most 24 characters, \"Class 2 · 640\"), and every 100 ms\nPLAN.md:616:  `AIHub.send({ t: 'g', e: classIndex, x, y, p: poseId, s: score }, { reliable: false })`. Never above 20 a second.\nPLAN.md:620:- Finished: `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })` once. Stats at most six, names at most 16 characters (\"Wobble Age\", \"Best hold\", \"Breath\"),\nPLAN.md:623:- If `engine.ready` is false (no WebGPU): `AIHub.fail('WebGPU required')`.\nPLAN.md:916:Use a function as `replace`'s second argument, as here: the bundle holds `$` patterns that a string replacement would corrupt. Everything is inlined, so no CDN is needed. Run from the dev folder; write the deliverable where your TASK.md says. `npm run format` will restyle `tags.html` and this script, harmlessly **[tested: the build still passes and the client stays pristine]**; Prettier leaves the `.txt` alone.\nPLAN.md:981:- **Hub harness:** serve the built file beside `harness.html`, `bridge.js`, `round.js` (Node `http` server or `python3 -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1`, read the port it prints, confirm the page is your game, stop only that PID: never `pkill`, `killall` or `fuser -k`). Run `harness.html?game=<file>&players=N&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1&play=8000` for N = 2, 3, 4, then `players=3&…&scenario=host-leave`. Pass means `window.__hubCheck.pass`, with `body[data-complete=\"true\"]` at the end. **Also assert in each frame** `__engine.ready === true`, zero engine errors, a `ghost` entity at 2 players; no console line starting `[AIHub]`; and that the pasted client's SHA-256 from banner to last line matches `529eac78c54cfff0e60d375a9c63f66d1a594327ddcc262a2bdf9b1f2fb6582a` (client 1.4.0; compare what you fetched first, the hub may have moved on).\nTASK.md:23:Working Environment and deliverable:\nTASK.md:109:Exit interview: before you finish, also save these answers as exit-interview.json in this folder's root, beside the game's .html: one JSON object in exactly the shape below, every value filled in (\"unknown\" for anything you can't confirm). Tools read it (the game's run record and the AI Hub catalogue), so write plain text, and check that the file parses as JSON.\nTASK.md:111:  \"sourceInformation\": {\"date\": \"\", \"source\": \"\", \"plan\": \"\", \"genre\": \"\", \"perspective\": \"\", \"tech\": \"\", \"artDirection\": \"\", \"animation\": \"\", \"audio\": \"\", \"online\": \"\", \"testing\": \"\", \"research\": \"\", \"environment\": \"\", \"model\": \"\", \"usage\": \"added on import\"},\nTASK.md:112:  \"testingFeedback\": [\"your answer to each Testing Feedback question, in order\"],\nTASK.md:113:  \"engineFeedback\": [\"your answer to each Engine Feedback question, in order\"],\nTASK.md:114:  \"promptFeedback\": [\"your answer to each Prompt Feedback question, in order\"],\n--- source files ---\n  201 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/main.ts\n   43 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/view.ts\n   95 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/wobble.ts\n   49 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/programme.ts\n   35 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/art.ts\n   20 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/audio.ts\n  443 total\n--- render imports ---\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:18: * // import { createEngine, defineScene } from '../../engine';\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:33:// Materials and procedural textures (WP 2.3): materials as data with three.js's classic parameters, seeded tiling\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:112:// A page's own presentation (WP 9.5): createEngine's onFrame, once per drawn frame, with the run to read and the camera.\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:115:export type { CameraPose } from './gfx/cameras/pose';\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:128:// brazier stands as recipe shapes; walls facing an outside camera cut low and pillars before the hero as stumps.\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:167:// frame (three.js's CSS2DRenderer pattern), HUD lines and a crosshair over the canvas; ui.state() for tests.\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:288:// Performance counters (WP 5.5): what `__engine.stats()` returns, means in ms and the renderer's counts, never fps.\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:297:// Clips in pages (WP 8.4): three.js's AnimationClip and AnimationMixer, for presentation only (a page plays a baked\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:300:/** three.js's animation clip: `AnimationClip.parse(clipJSON(baked, skeleton))` makes one from a baked clip. */\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:301:export { AnimationClip } from 'three/webgpu';\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:302:/** three.js's animation mixer: plays clips on an object's bones (a puppet's mesh), for presentation only. */\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:303:export { AnimationMixer } from 'three/webgpu';\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:309:// with telegraphs on the floor, socket trails, bolts and camera shake by a view's effects; never part of the hash.\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts:350:export * from './gfx/cameras/api';\nWee-Fit-Ret