-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/gfx/sceneDump.ts:37:/** What `dumpScene` writes. */\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/gfx/sceneDump.ts:62:  const type = mesh.isInstancedMesh ? 'InstancedMesh' : object.type; // three.js types an InstancedMesh 'Mesh'\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/gfx/sceneDump.ts:101:export function dumpScene(root: Object3D, options: DumpOptions = {}): string {\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:6: * `burstLife`) and per view (`turntable` four, `front` one: a camera 25° up round what the stage draws,\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:7: * `fitCamera`; a camera code as written).\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:8: * The gallery's scene (engine/dev/galleryScene.ts) stages each frame through its recorded dev action `show`, and\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:35:import { formatCameraCode } from '../gfx/cameras/codes';\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:37:import { ORBIT_FOV } from '../gfx/cameras/orbit';\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:38:import { GALLERY_AT, galleryScene } from './galleryScene';\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:49:/** One frame of an entry: what the scene stages for it, how long it holds and plays, and where the camera stands. */\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:59:  /** The camera: an orbit azimuth (°) fitted round the subject, or a camera code drawn as written. */\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:91:/** The kinds the gallery stages (engine/dev/galleryScene.ts), with how it films each. */\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:112:/** The orbit views of the camera words (engine/core/gallery.ts `GALLERY_CAMERAS`), azimuths in degrees. */\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:140:  const { camera, duration, states } = (registry.get(kind, id) as unknown as { gallery: Gallery }).gallery;\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:144:  const views: readonly (number | string)[] = Object.hasOwn(VIEWS, camera) ? VIEWS[camera] : [camera];\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:159:/** A fitted view's lens, degrees: the orbit camera's (engine/gfx/cameras/orbit.ts). */\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:163: * The camera code of a frame's view: a code as written, or a fixed camera (engine/gfx/cameras/fixed.ts) standing at\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:166: * camera, not an orbit, since an orbit stands no nearer than 1 m and a switch's plate wants 0.3 m.\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:189: * scene on `registry` (galleryScene.ts).\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/gallery.ts:198:  galleryScene(registry);\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/stats.ts:6: * timestamp queries: engine/gfx/enhanced/timing.ts; absent elsewhere), and the renderer's counts: the last frame's\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/stats.ts:16: * from `counts()`, the renderer's (engine/gfx/renderer.ts `stats()`), when `stats()` is called; without a renderer\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/stats.ts:31:import type { GfxStats } from '../gfx/renderer';\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/dev/stats.ts:51:/** The renderer's counts the meter reports (engine/gfx/renderer.ts `GfxStats`)