Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/styles.css\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/view.ts\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/index.html\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/wobble.ts\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/cast/player.ts\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/replays/bot.replay.json\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/tools/bundle.mjs\n--- PROGRESS ---\n# Wee Fit Retreat — progress\n\n## Current phase\n\n- The required my-3dge workspace is checked out at `2dbd829`.\n- The standalone `Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055.html` builds successfully from `labs/game`.\n- Continue with engine integration, browser validation, and the required final handoff.\n\n## Implementation checklist\n\n- [x] Build activity progression, wobble simulation, controls, and local persistence.\n- [x] Add an original 2D island presentation, synthesized effects, and settings.\n- [ ] Investigate 3D engine and AI Hub ghost integration; the current build has neither.\n- [ ] Complete presentation, synthesized music, accessibility, and developer tools.\n- [ ] Run the headless and cross-viewport/browser checks; address discovered issues.\n- [ ] Complete the About/credits information and `exit-interview.json`.\n\n## Testing notes\n\n- Issues caught: not yet measured. Critical issues: not yet measured.\n--- AVAILABLE 3D HELPERS ---\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/index.ts\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/world/terrainNav.ts\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/world/site.ts\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/world/awareness.ts\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/engine/world/nav.ts\nWee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-te