{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_654","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"pwd; cat PROGRESS.md; printf '\\\\n--- FILES ---\\\\n'; ls -lh; printf '\\\\n--- GAME SOURCES ---\\\\n'; wc -l Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/{main.ts,view.ts,wobble.ts,programme.ts,styles.css,audio.ts}; printf '\\\\n--- RUNNING SERVERS ---\\\\n'; ss -ltnp | grep -E '44335|python' || true\"","aggregated_output":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-terra-max.build-v2__20261104-224055__x54facc/work\n# Wee Fit Retreat — progress\n\n## Current phase\n\n- The required my-3dge workspace is checked out at `2dbd829`.\n- The standalone `Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055.html` builds successfully from `labs/game`.\n- Continue with engine integration, browser validation, and the required final handoff.\n\n## Implementation checklist\n\n- [x] Build activity progression, wobble simulation, controls, and local persistence.\n- [x] Add an original 2D island presentation, synthesized effects, and settings.\n- [ ] Investigate 3D engine and AI Hub ghost integration; the current build has neither.\n- [ ] Complete presentation, synthesized music, accessibility, and developer tools.\n- [ ] Run the headless and cross-viewport/browser checks; address discovered issues.\n- [ ] Complete the About/credits information and `exit-interview.json`.\n\n## Testing notes\n\n- Issues caught: not yet measured. Critical issues: not yet measured.\n\n--- FILES ---\ntotal 148K\n-rw-r--r--  1 micha micha  80K Nov  4 22:40 PLAN.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 micha micha  936 Nov  5 04:15 PROGRESS.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 micha micha  13K Nov  4 22:40 TASK.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 11 micha micha 4.0K Nov  4 22:55 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055\n-rw-r--r--  1 micha micha  43K Nov  5 03:54 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055.html\n\n--- GAME SOURCES ---\n  201 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/main.ts\n   43 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/view.ts\n   95 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/wobble.ts\n   49 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/programme.ts\n    2 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/styles.css\n   20 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055/labs/game/audio.ts\n  410 total\n\n--- RUNNING SERVERS ---\nLISTEN 0      5           127.0.0.1:45673      0.0.0.0:*    users:((\"python3\",pid=797424,fd=3))     \nLISTEN 0      5           127.0.0.1:45839      0.0.0.0:*    users:((\"python3\",pid=1145436,fd=3))    \nLISTEN 0      5           127.0.0.1:46713      0.0.0.0:*    users:((\"python3\",pid=1324260,fd=3))    \nLISTEN 0      5           127.0.0.1:46829      0.0.0.0:*    users:((\"python3\",pid=633196,fd=3))     \nLISTEN 0      5           127.0.0.1:37941      0.0.0.0:*    users:((\"python3\",pid=1229180,fd=3))    \nLISTEN 0      5           127.0.0.1:38347      0.0.0.0:*    users:((\"python3.14\",pid=1321211,fd=3)) \n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
