{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_689","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat PROGRESS.md; printf '\\\\n--- requirements index ---\\\\n'; rg -n '\"'^#{1,3} |AIHub|@file|exit-interview|Dev Mode|10%|10 seconds'\"' PLAN.md TASK.md | head -180; printf '\\\\n--- source line counts ---\\\\n'; wc -l labs/game/*.ts labs/game/*.css 2>/dev/null || true; printf '\\\\n--- workspace locations ---\\\\n'; ls -la\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_689","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat PROGRESS.md; printf '\\\\n--- requirements index ---\\\\n'; rg -n '\"'^#{1,3} |AIHub|@file|exit-interview|Dev Mode|10%|10 seconds'\"' PLAN.md TASK.md | head -180; printf '\\\\n--- source line counts ---\\\\n'; wc -l labs/game/*.ts labs/game/*.css 2>/dev/null || true; printf '\\\\n--- workspace locations ---\\\\n'; ls -la\"","aggregated_output":"# Wee Fit Retreat — progress\n\n## Current phase\n\n- The required my-3dge workspace is checked out at `2dbd829`.\n- The standalone `Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055.html` builds successfully from `labs/game`.\n- Continue with engine integration, browser validation, and the required final handoff.\n\n## Implementation checklist\n\n- [x] Build activity progression, wobble simulation, controls, and local persistence.\n- [x] Add an original 2D island presentation, synthesized effects, and settings.\n- [ ] Investigate 3D engine and AI Hub ghost integration; the current build has neither.\n- [ ] Complete presentation, synthesized music, accessibility, and developer tools.\n- [ ] Run the headless and cross-viewport/browser checks; address discovered issues.\n- [ ] Complete the About/credits information and `exit-interview.json`.\n\n## Testing notes\n\n- Issues caught: not yet measured. Critical issues: not yet measured.\n\n--- requirements index ---\nTASK.md:19:Audio: All music, sound effects and voices are written in code, with no audio files. Voices are Animalese/Simlish-style gibberish. Music is to be set to 10% volume by default.\nTASK.md:32:## This computer\nTASK.md:48:### What this computer doesn't have\nTASK.md:59:### Sharing this computer\nTASK.md:66:## Goal\nTASK.md:76:Attract Mode: After 10 seconds without input on the title/menu screen, start a looping AI-played demo or scripted replay (arcade/kiosk style); any input exits it. The AI (or replay) can be simple and may cheat freely (infinite health, ammo, abilities, no clip, etc). Its only job is to show as much of the demo as possible, the attract mode is not meant to balance the game.\nTASK.md:82:## UI & UX: 10-Foot Controller-First Philosophy\nTASK.md:89:## Done\nTASK.md:92:## Source Information\nTASK.md:109:Exit interview: before you finish, also save these answers as exit-interview.json in this folder's root, beside the game's .html: one JSON object in exactly the shape below, every value filled in (\"unknown\" for anything you can't confirm). Tools read it (the game's run record and the AI Hub catalogue), so write plain text, and check that the file parses as JSON.\nPLAN.md:1:# Game plan: a balance-and-wellness game inspired by Wii Fit\nPLAN.md:17:## 1. The game\nPLAN.md:57:## 2. World and cast\nPLAN.md:108:## 3. The one verb: the Wobble Model\nPLAN.md:176:## 4. Controls\nPLAN.md:247:## 5. Structure\nPLAN.md:291:## 6. Activities\nPLAN.md:312:### Morning Check (about 75 s)\nPLAN.md:323:### Pose Class (about 2.5 min, three poses)\nPLAN.md:345:### Reps Hall (about 90 s, three exercises)\nPLAN.md:358:### Step Class (about 100 s)\nPLAN.md:367:**Beat audio goes on the effects bus, not the music bus.** Music defaults to 10%, so the song is only a bed. Sim `beat`\nPLAN.md:371:### Still Pond (75 s; 45 s in rounds)\nPLAN.md:394:### The Line (about 75 s)\nPLAN.md:403:### Paddle Glide (75 s)\nPLAN.md:410:### Sand Garden (90 s, five trays)\nPLAN.md:417:### Cliff Plunge (three dives)\nPLAN.md:424:### Hoop Patrol (60 s)\nPLAN.md:432:### Island Jog (about 150 s)\nPLAN.md:439:### Group Class\nPLAN.md:445:## 7. The finale: The Great Tilt (about 4 minutes)\nPLAN.md:480:## 8. Screens and UX\nPLAN.md:516:  Resume, Restart Activity, Back to the Island, Settings, Controls, Dev Mode, About / Credits, Quit to Title.\nPLAN.md:517:- **Settings:** Music (**10% by default**), Effects, Voices, Button icons, Mouse sensitivity, Invert look, Rumble, Steadier Hands (an\nPLAN.md:523:**Dev Mode** (from the pause menu; absent in hub sessions; a clear panel that works with pad, keyboard and mouse):\nPLAN.md:547:## 9. Multiplayer\nPLAN.md:555:### On its own: Group Class\nPLAN.md:564:### In AI Hub: AI Hub Session Protocol v1, mode **ghost**\nPLAN.md:593:const AIHub = window.AIHub;\nPLAN.md:594:const info = AIHub?.active ? await AIHub.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true }) : null;\nPLAN.md:596:const watchdog = info ? setTimeout(() => AIHub.ready(), 14000) : 0;   // the harness allows 20 s after hello\nPLAN.md:598:if (info) { clearTimeout(watchdog); AIHub.ready(); }\nPLAN.md:610:  Keys: Enter or Cross answers `AIHub.answer('ready')`, Triangle or T answers `'more'`, a tap or click works too. Listen for Enter with your own\nPLAN.md:611:  `keydown` on `window`: the harness sends a synthetic one. The card has no menus or choices, and draws numbers only from `AIHub.rng('card')`.\nPLAN.md:613:- `start` arrives; play begins at `AIHub.time() >= 0`. Send the sim `round.go` then (scene action). On `start` also send one\nPLAN.md:614:  `AIHub.progress({ score: 0, label: 'Breathing in' })` and one ghost message, so a slow copy still passes the harness.\nPLAN.md:615:- During play: `AIHub.progress({ score, label })` whenever it changes (label at most 24 characters, \"Class 2 · 640\"), and every 100 ms\nPLAN.md:616:  `AIHub.send({ t: 'g', e: classIndex, x, y, p: poseId, s: score }, { reliable: false })`. Never above 20 a second.\nPLAN.md:620:- Finished: `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })` once. Stats at most six, names at most 16 characters (\"Wobble Age\", \"Best hold\", \"Breath\"),\nPLAN.md:623:- If `engine.ready` is false (no WebGPU): `AIHub.fail('WebGPU required')`.\nPLAN.md:635:## 10. Art direction\nPLAN.md:683:## 11. Animation\nPLAN.md:733:## 12. Audio\nPLAN.md:750:**Music is 10% by default:** right after `createAudio()`, call `audio.volume('music', 0.1)`. The engine's default is 0.5 **[source]**. Settings shows it as 10%. Test `audio.volume('music') === 0.1` on a fresh save. Mix each song so it is fine at 100% and a whisper at 10%; nothing the player needs may live only in music.\nPLAN.md:782:**Checks:** `node x qa audio`, and in the browser read levels with an `AnalyserNode` or render through an `OfflineAudioContext` (`createAudio({ context })`). Nobody can listen here, so prove each voice and song makes sound, and that music sits at 10%.\nPLAN.md:786:## 13. Writing\nPLAN.md:831:## 14. Tech\nPLAN.md:866:**Suggested layout** (each file under 400 lines, 600 is a hard error, each opening with a `@file` comment; no enums; no `any`):\nPLAN.md:887:// labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs  (add its @file comment). Usage: node labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs <output.html>\nPLAN.md:922:## 15. Engine traps (hit on this machine unless marked **[source]**)\nPLAN.md:952:## 16. Testing\nPLAN.md:976:- **Pause and dev:** pause menu reaches Dev Mode; a slider changes behaviour; Reset restores defaults; jumps work; not present in a session.\nPLAN.md:981:- **Hub harness:** serve the built file beside `harness.html`, `bridge.js`, `round.js` (Node `http` server or `python3 -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1`, read the port it prints, confirm the page is your game, stop only that PID: never `pkill`, `killall` or `fuser -k`). Run `harness.html?game=<file>&players=N&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1&play=8000` for N = 2, 3, 4, then `players=3&…&scenario=host-leave`. Pass means `window.__hubCheck.pass`, with `body[data-complete=\"true\"]` at the end. **Also assert in each frame** `__engine.ready === true`, zero engine errors, a `ghost` entity at 2 players; no console line starting `[AIHub]`; and that the pasted client's SHA-256 from banner to last line matches `529eac78c54cfff0e60d375a9c63f66d1a594327ddcc262a2bdf9b1f2fb6582a` (client 1.4.0; compare what you fetched first, the hub may have moved on).\nPLAN.md:984:**Screenshots, at the end, by eye, 1920 × 1080:** title, island, Pose Class HUD, Still Pond with a lure, The Line, Great Tilt wide shot, results, pause, Dev Mode, About. `node x shot labs/game --png` or a Playwright screenshot: both worked here.\nPLAN.md:988:## 17. Build order\nPLAN.md:1001:10. **The shell.** Attract, full Dev Mode, Settings, Controls, About, touch-only, no-WebGPU page.\nPLAN.md:1005:**Cut line, if and only if you run out of budget.** Cut whole things and re-flow `days.ts`, leaving no trace (no greyed-out rows, no mentions), in this order: Great Tilt step 3 → Expert variants and outfits → Hoop Patrol → Reps Hall → Island Jog's race (keep the walk) → Cliff Plunge → Step Class. Never cut: Morning Check, Pose Class, Still Pond, The Line, Sand Garden, Paddle Glide, Great Tilt steps 1, 2, 4 and 5, Group Class, hub ghost round, attract, Dev Mode, About.\nPLAN.md:1009:## 18. Done\nPLAN.md:1019:## 19. Reports\nPLAN.md:1025:Answers already decided: Plan: the name this file has in your folder. Genre and Perspective as in section 1. Tech: my-3dge at its pinned commit, three.js r182 on WebGPU, Rapier 0.21, Vite, TypeScript. Art: the engine's native toon puppets and generators with new retreat assets. Animation: the engine's clip layer and humanoid with a new readable clip set scrubbed from the sim. Audio: tracker songs, `defineSfx` effects, gibberish syllable voices, all code, music at 10%. Online: AI Hub Session Protocol v1, ghost; same-screen Group Class on its own. Environment and Model as your TASK.md gives them. Usage: \"added on import\".\nPLAN.md:1033:## 20. Brief-to-plan map\nPLAN.md:1046:| Audio: all code, no files; gibberish voices; music 10% default | 12 |\n\n--- source line counts ---\n0 total\n\n--- workspace locations ---\ntotal 156\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 micha micha  4096 Nov  5 03:54 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 micha micha  4096 Nov  4 22:40 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 micha micha 81516 Nov  4 22:40 PLAN.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 micha micha   936 Nov  5 04:15 PROGRESS.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 micha micha 12560 Nov  4 22:40 TASK.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 11 micha micha  4096 Nov  4 22:55 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055\n-rw-r--r--  1 micha micha 43976 Nov  5 03:54 Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055.html\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
