ssed wrong:</b> The requested WebGPU scene and AI Hub ghost session remain unresolved.<br><b>Built independently:</b> The activity simulation, input mapping, presentation, audio and persistence.<br><b>Hardest part:</b> Fitting a full 3D WebGPU integration into the implementation while preserving a reliable standalone build.<br><b>Engine changes:</b> None; the vendored engine is unchanged.<br><b>Suggested improvement:</b> A minimal, documented single-file starter combining rendering, input and build tooling.</p>\n11:    <h3>Prompt feedback</h3><p><b>Liked most:</b> The detailed activity, interaction and atmosphere brief.<br><b>Confusing:</b> The boundary between the core deliverable and the engine and online requirements.<br><b>Hardest:</b> Delivering the full 3D and multiplayer scope alongside the portable build.<br><b>Suggested improvement:</b> Separate minimum functionality from stretch goals and provide a small integration reference.</p>\nchromium: all About sections present\nwebkit: all About sections present\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
