{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_889","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat PROGRESS.md'","aggregated_output":"# Wee Fit Retreat — progress\n\n## Current phase\n\n- The required my-3dge workspace is checked out at `2dbd829`.\n- The standalone `Wee-Fit-Retreat-Wii-Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-224055.html` builds successfully from `labs/game`.\n- Credits and handoff are drafted; verify the final build and browser behavior.\n\n## Implementation checklist\n\n- [x] Build activity progression, wobble simulation, controls, and local persistence.\n- [x] Add an original 2D island presentation, synthesized effects, and settings.\n- [ ] Investigate 3D engine and AI Hub ghost integration; the current build has neither.\n- [x] Add presentation, synthesized music, accessibility, and developer tools.\n- [ ] Run final headless and cross-viewport/browser checks.\n- [x] Complete the About/credits information and `exit-interview.json`.\n\n## Testing notes\n\n- Initial viewport matrix: 24 screenshots across phone, tablet, desktop, Chromium, Firefox, and WebKit completed without reported overflow or JavaScript errors.\n- Visual inspection found that the welcome action fell below the fold on a landscape phone; responsive layout fix added, pending final verification.\n- Issues caught: at least one. Critical issues: not yet measured.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
